# Cargo build output.
target/

# Cargo.lock IS committed (see core/Cargo.lock). Convention says a library omits it;
# this repo's rule is stronger and applies here for the same reason `pnpm-lock.yaml`
# is committed and enforced by a pre-push hook: a dependency resolved fresh on every
# CI run is a dependency nobody chose. The lockfile is what makes "the tests passed"
# a statement about a specific set of code.
